{"id": "en_story_ralston", "tag": "TRUE STORY", "cta": "MORE TRUE STORIES LIKE THIS", "ctaSmall": "follow", "ctaWhere": "new story every day", "accent": "#FF8C42", "lang": "en", "total": 66.37, "segments": [{"text": "In April 2003 Aron Ralston is hiking alone in Bluejohn Canyon and tells no one his exact route.", "start": 0.0, "end": 5.36}, {"text": "A massive boulder suddenly shifts and traps his right arm firmly against the cold stone canyon wall.", "start": 5.84, "end": 10.34}, {"text": "He remains completely stuck in the remote desert wilderness for more than five long and brutal days.", "start": 10.9, "end": 15.2}, {"text": "During this terrifying ordeal he survives with very little water left inside his small hydration pack.", "start": 15.88, "end": 20.26}, {"text": "With time running out and death approaching he makes a horrifying choice to save his own life.", "start": 20.8, "end": 24.56}, {"text": "He uses a dull multi-tool to amputate his trapped forearm and finally breaks free from the stone.", "start": 25.0, "end": 29.66}, {"text": "Bleeding and in immense pain he manages to rappel down a steep cliff face into the canyon.", "start": 30.26, "end": 34.08}, {"text": "He hikes out across the harsh terrain until he finally meets a helpful family of local hikers.", "start": 34.62, "end": 38.64}, {"text": "A rescue helicopter arrives quickly and picks him up to transport him safely to the nearest hospital.", "start": 39.22, "end": 43.04}, {"text": "He spends about 127 hours trapped alone before his miraculous and unbelievable escape from the canyon.", "start": 43.7, "end": 48.76}, {"text": "His incredible survival story teaches every single outdoor adventurer a very vital and life-saving lesson today.", "start": 49.24, "end": 54.34}, {"text": "You must always tell someone trustworthy exactly where you are going before entering the wilderness alone.", "start": 54.98, "end": 59.2}, {"text": "Would you have the unimaginable mental strength to do what he did to sur